      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense from a certain perspective. I'm just wondering, though, if I present it that way, I might be overlooking the other valid viewpoint. Is there any real legal basis for the idea that we should stick strictly to procedural due process instead, or is that just an argument people use to block civil rights progress?",
